Package: com.local.everynotifyvibe
Name: EveryNotifyVibe
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Forces each enabled app notification to vibrate, including repeated/grouped alerts iOS 16 may normally deliver silently. Includes master, per-app, Enable All and Disable All controls.
Maintainer: EveryNotifyVibe
Author: EveryNotifyVibe
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
